        "created_at": "2014-08-19T02:48:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>okay, soo once the hunting drone attacks and is removed from the map where does it go? does the card go back into your hand or is it put out of play until you are incompacitated and it returns once you rally?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also, can you constantly use the clocking device? you play it during the power up phase and during the to be continued phase it ambuscade dissapears. once the power up phase comes back around and the card returns to your hand, can you play it again or do you have to replace it with something else? making the clocking device only work every other turn.</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:42:15.172Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 1,
        "reads": 0,
        "readers_count": 0,
        "score": 5.0,
